include/
└── config.h   — project-wide tuning constants, shared across all environments

config.h is the first file to edit on competition day. Sections:

  Light Ring
    LDR_THRESHOLDS[32]        per-sensor white/green thresholds (run calibration to generate)
    LDR_SAMPLES               ADC samples averaged per sensor read
    MUX_SETTLE_US             µs to wait after mux channel switch before reading
    CALIBRATION_READS_PER_SAMPLE

  Main Loop
    LOOP_DELAY_MS             layer1 polling period

  Layer 2 — Motor Trim
    FR_TRIM, BR_TRIM,         per-motor speed multipliers (0.0–1.0)
    BL_TRIM, FL_TRIM          slowest motor stays at 1.0; reduce faster motors

  Layer 2 — IMU Correction
    YAW_KP/KI/KD/I_MAX       heading-hold PID gains
    YAW_CORRECTION_MAX        max omega correction added by yaw PID (0–1 scale)
    ACCEL_KP                  drift correction proportional gain
    ACCEL_CORRECTION_MAX      max vx/vy correction from accel

No other files need to be touched for day-of tuning.
